{"id":"5afd25b07b64f3c2","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-m-completeness.md","title":"m-Completeness","display":"df-m-completeness — m-Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-m-completeness","aliases":["68-df-m-completeness"],"display":"df-m-completeness — m-Completeness","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-many-one-reducibility]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§16 completeness definition p.59; §17.1 p.63 / PDF 68,72","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-m-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-m-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-m-completeness — m-Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5845ef9114a1d1d9\" href=\"?note=5845ef9114a1d1d9\" title=\"68-df-many-one-reducibility\">68-df-many-one-reducibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§16 completeness definition p.59; §17.1 p.63 / PDF 68,72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{mComplete}\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mComplete}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(B\\leq_m A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{mComplete}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(B\\leq_m A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §16，印刷 p.59 / PDF p.68，用 §13 的 many-one reducibility 定义 Φ-complete；这里取 Φ 为一元 RE 集合类。§17.1，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72，将此 RE completeness 与 creative 对应。假设域允许所有 A⊆N，RE 条件保留在定义内部，避免把非 RE 集的谓词值留空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-many-one-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"5845ef9114a1d1d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-many-one-reducibility]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{mComplete}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(B\\leq_m A).","display":true}],"bytes":1160,"backlinks":[{"id":"719191db2e194527","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}$ 见 [[68-df-creative-set]]，$\\mathrm{mComplete}$ 见 [[68-df-m-completeness]]。参数化所用递归函数编号见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。"},{"id":"4d392f39bfd06262","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-m-completeness]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-m-completeness]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-m-completeness|df-m-completeness — m-Completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","5845ef9114a1d1d9"]}